<title>USA: SunRiver names Wayne Schroeder as CFO.</title>
<headline>SunRiver names Wayne Schroeder as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>SunRiver Corp said Thursday it has appointed Wayne Schroeder as chief financial officer as part of its recently initiated corporate restructuring program.</p>
<p>Schroeder has served as both a consultant and controller of SunRiver since July 1995, the company said.  </p>
<p>Schroeder replaces Roger Hughes, who resigned as chief financial officer in November.</p>
